d-tied to 3.3V. The PWM1 GPIO is pulled up through 1k and cannot drive the pan servo, so PWM mode on channel 1 is non-functional. In serial mode, J8 pin 3 is also forced to 3.3V via R13, which would corrupt the shared bus.\", \"confidence\": 0.85}]}",
